!!! An arithmetic operator applied to a freshly built choice value.
!!!
!!! 'holding' takes a single term, so it binds tighter than every arithmetic
!!! operator: 'Outcome.Failed holding "unknown: " plus sku' built the variant
!!! from the literal alone and handed THAT to 'plus'. Nothing rejected it. The
!!! program compiled clean, ran, and matched no arm of its own 'consider', so
!!! it silently did nothing -- the worst available outcome. A real project
!!! spent a session concluding the VM could not construct variants at all.
book diagnostic.holding-payload-arithmetic

Outcome begin choice
    when Ready holding number
    when Failed holding text
end choice

describe receives sku as text returns Outcome begin paragraph
    give Outcome.Failed holding "unknown: " plus sku
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    evaluate describe with sku being "X"
    give 0
end paragraph
